// Criterion: an `rwir` declaration shares the signature form of `rwfunc` without a body; the runtime provides the implementation.
// Treating a bodyless `rwir` as a syntax error would cause layout to reject this file.
// Reference: syntax notes in `runtimec/specification/native_rwir_decls.kv`.
// Expected output:
//   1

rwir demo·echo(*int64 #x) -> (*int64 #r)

rwfunc test() -> () {
	println(1)
}
